Who is the orchestrator in your project?



LangGraph is the workflow orchestrator. It manages the execution of all AI agents, maintains the shared state, and controls the end-to-end workflow.
LangChain is used inside individual agents for prompt management, LLM interaction, and RAG integration, 
while Groq provides the language model, Qdrant stores vector embeddings, Gmail API handles email communication, and Gradio provides the user interface.

========

| Technology                | Responsibility                                   |
| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| **LangGraph**             | ✅ Multi-Agent Workflow Orchestrator              |
| **LangChain**             | Prompt Engineering, Chains, LLM Integration, RAG |
| **Groq**                  | Large Language Model                             |
| **Qdrant**                | Vector Database (Knowledge Base)                 |
| **Sentence Transformers** | Embedding Generation                             |
| **Gmail API**             | Email Reading & Sending                          |
| **Gradio**                | Enterprise Dashboard / UI                        |


